{"title":"Ogre Youth","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 30 Ogre that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 2 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 58 total, 14–22 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-knick\" title=\"Ogrewax Knick - in 100% of 2 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b734a810757d0d5d1409.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 2/2</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Ogre: <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt\">Gaunt Ogre</a> <span class=\"muted\">(33)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre\">Ogre</a> <span class=\"muted\">(35)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler\">Ogre Mauler</a> <span class=\"muted\">(38)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher\">Ogre Butcher</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger\">Ogre Charger</a> <span class=\"muted\">(42)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman\">Ogre Shaman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(44)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder\">Ogre Elder</a> <span class=\"muted\">(46)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain\">Mountain Ogre</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-warchief\">Ogre Warchief</a> <span class=\"muted\">(54)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/8fe05349771531a800b3.webp\" alt=\"Ogre Youth\"></div><h3>Ogre Youth</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>30</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Ogre</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>118</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>21</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.4 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.7</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>Not yet</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}